Vondel Server
=============

Vondel is an independent hard fork of Silo Server, based initially on upstream
revision 1dcdd4b2 from https://github.com/Silo-Server/silo-server.

The source remains licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. Existing copyright and
license notices are retained. Vondel's changes include a new project/module
identity, executable name, defaults, deployment examples, documentation, and
original visual assets.

Vondel is not affiliated with or endorsed by Silo Media L.L.C. Silo names that
remain in protocol headers, discovery records, plugin identifiers, migration
keys, or environment variables are retained solely for interoperability and
safe upgrades.
